      "value": "I wanted to add to this request a similar, yet distinct, post of my own. It's similar to this in that it shows you that others have initialized av3, but I feel it is distinct in that it only cares about whether your animator has initialized or not and allows the creator to handle only what they deem necessary with it.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/add-initialized-public-parameter",
